{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Coreless: Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 3168820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Coreless</strong> is a third-person, single-player action roguelike that brings a fresh twist to meta-progression through its flexible talent and power systems. Choose from a wide variety of avatars, enhance them with talent points, and equip them with distinctive addons. Each adventure promises unique challenges and experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highly Customizable Avatars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle using a rich combination of talents, addons, and in-session powers. Whether you envision a spellcaster striking from afar, a melee warrior dealing stuns and damage over time, or an assassin summoning minions to create distractions, the choice is entirely yours. Unlock new avatars, powers, and addons to forge a truly distinctive build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tick-Based Addon System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, surviving tougher encounters earns you Ticks\u2014your performance currency. These Ticks unlock addon drops and Affix Milestones that enhance those addons. Addons are central to your build: passive addons may grant powers at session start, plague enemies periodically, or provide shields or extra lives. Event-based addons activate based on the socket they're placed in\u2014some let you double-dash to collect nearby buffs, others trigger effects during Overdrive abilities. The more Ticks you gather in a session, the higher your chances of powerful drops. Simply put: the longer you survive, the better the rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Challenging Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is packed with upgrade options, diverse foes, and hidden unlockables. Optimize your growth during every encounter before the Heat Meter hits 100%, triggering a boss battle. Defeating these unique enemies rewards you with gear to power future runs. Unlock new difficulty levels, environments, and enemy types for escalating challenge and reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continuous Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in defeat, progress continues. Earn permanent upgrades such as talent points, addons and resources. Each step forward opens up new strategic possibilities for future attempts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Coreless</strong> is a third-person, single-player action roguelike that brings a fresh twist to meta-progression through its flexible talent and power systems. Choose from a wide variety of avatars, enhance them with talent points, and equip them with distinctive addons. Each adventure promises unique challenges and experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highly Customizable Avatars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle using a rich combination of talents, addons, and in-session powers. Whether you envision a spellcaster striking from afar, a melee warrior dealing stuns and damage over time, or an assassin summoning minions to create distractions, the choice is entirely yours. Unlock new avatars, powers, and addons to forge a truly distinctive build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.poster.avif?t=1753077310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.webm?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168820/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.mp4?t=1753077310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tick-Based Addon System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, surviving tougher encounters earns you Ticks\u2014your performance currency. These Ticks unlock addon drops and Affix Milestones that enhance those addons. Addons are central to your build: passive addons may grant powers at session start, plague enemies periodically, or provide shields or extra lives. Event-based addons activate based on the socket they're placed in\u2014some let you double-dash to collect nearby buffs, others trigger effects during Overdrive abilities. The more Ticks you gather in a session, the higher your chances of powerful drops. Simply put: the longer you survive, the better the rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Challenging Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is packed with upgrade options, diverse foes, and hidden unlockables. Optimize your growth during every encounter before the Heat Meter hits 100%, triggering a boss battle. Defeating these unique enemies rewards you with gear to power future runs. Unlock new difficulty levels, environments, and enemy types for escalating challenge and reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continuous Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in defeat, progress continues. Earn permanent upgrades such as talent points, addons and resources. Each step forward opens up new strategic possibilities for future attempts.</p>",
    "short_description": "Coreless is a single-player roguelike action game set in a sci-fi world, featuring a unique meta-progression system for deep customization. Experiment with diverse avatars, abilities, and powers to tackle challenging bosses in this dynamic adventure.",
